# to contain a string that looks like a credential -- an AWS access key id, a
# GitHub token, a PEM header, an OpenRouter key. Every value is synthetic;
# `redaction.known_secret_values` confirms none of them equals a live value.
# Verified at the time of writing: 38 matches across these five files, 0 of them
# matching any of the 13 live secret values the process knows about.
